OL,3,AChrista Pike in critical condition
OL,4,Aafter surviving two lethal injections,
OL,5,Alawyer says
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrison officials administered two
OL,8,Flethal doses of pentobarbital to Pike
OL,9,Fon Wednesday, but she survived and was
OL,10,Ftaken to hospital.
OL,12,FPike, 50, was sentenced to death in
OL,13,F1996 for the murder of Colleen Slemmer.
